      "writtenOn": "2016-09-01T15:51:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why declare all these methods with an _. I guess you are thinking that they are private, and not meant to be invoked by external clients, but at the same time, I\u0027m wondering if these functions would be useful to external clients. Is it always the case that clients will go through \"validate\".",
