      "writtenOn": "2016-09-01T15:51:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should add a \"_validate\" prefix to everything. The code would be slightly longer, but it would also be more clear. _metric_value as a function name, doesn\u0027t tell me what it does.",
